
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Astronomer)
    participant API as API Server
    participant GCS as GeminiControlSystem
    participant ACM as AccessManager
    participant SCH as QueueScheduler
    participant SAF as SafetyManager
    participant SUB as Telescope/Instrument
    participant DAQ as DataAcquisition
    participant DB as Archive Storage

    U->>API: Submit Observing Queue
    API->>GCS: add_queue(queue_data)
    GCS->>ACM: verify_access(user, Planning)
    ACM-->>GCS: Access Granted
    GCS->>SCH: add_block(blocks)
    SCH-->>GCS: Queue Updated

    Note over GCS,DAQ: Automated Execution Loop
    GCS->>SCH: get_next_block()
    SCH-->>GCS: ObservingBlock
    GCS->>SAF: check_safety()
    SAF-->>GCS: Safety OK
    GCS->>SUB: move(target_coords)
    SUB->>SUB: HardwareInterface.write()
    SUB-->>GCS: Move Complete
    GCS->>SUB: configure(exposure)
    SUB-->>GCS: Config Ready
    GCS->>DAQ: acquire_data(subsystem)
    DAQ->>SUB: readout()
    SUB-->>DAQ: RawData
    DAQ->>DAQ: Convert to FITS
    DAQ->>DB: archive_data(FITSData)
    DB-->>DAQ: Storage Path
    DAQ-->>GCS: Acquisition Complete
    GCS->>API: Update Status
    API-->>U: Notify Completion
